## Why This Is Asked

Evaluates the ability to design and align schemas across multiple API protocols, with particular focus on cursor-based pagination semantics and streaming patterns.

## Key Concepts

- Unified contract registry with synchronized schema definitions
- Cursor-based pagination with consistent after/page semantics
- Field projection and partial responses
- Protocol-specific adapters for per-protocol mapping
- Schema versioning and contract compatibility tests
- Streaming response patterns (gRPC)

## Code Example

